                                                "sense_id": "e2b4b456-175b-3738-b8e2-3e757fb09f7f",
                                                "text": "Because, despite his very small role as shark victim Alex Kintner when he was 12, Voorhees is still being paid residuals – royalties – 50 years later. Every time Jaws is on TV, he earns money. […] “It pays to die,” is how he put it in a recent interview with Syfy."
